  "description": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Reusable AAS submodel template (an IDTA-style 'profile') for machine operational telemetry. Any device's AAS submodel that declares this as its submodel-level semanticId is asserting conformance: it exposes exactly these properties, with these types and units, regardless of the raw protocol or tag layout underneath. This is what lets a modern IE-connected CNC and a legacy S7 grinder normalize into the same shape."
    }
  ],
